WEBVTT

00:58.720 --> 01:00.120
Report.

01:01.600 --> 01:02.920
The west gate can't hold.

01:03.000 --> 01:04.400
General Liu requests reinforcements.

01:07.080 --> 01:08.480
Report.

01:09.240 --> 01:10.560
General Zhu was shot by an enemy general.

01:10.680 --> 01:12.680
Has been withdrawn from the walls.

01:27.000 --> 01:29.280
Brother-in-law we should consider retreat.

01:30.240 --> 01:35.520
Yiyang has held until today no one can blame the fault on us keep our lives.

01:35.600 --> 01:37.267
To plan for the future.

